# The vendored LiveTrackMapCard bundle is committed byte for byte as released
# (tools/vendor_card.py checks its SHA-256). The release carries CRLF pairs; with
# core.autocrlf=true git would otherwise rewrite them to LF on commit, and the
# repository (and HACS) would ship a file that is not the release. Backlog 291.
custom_components/*/frontend/** -text -diff
# The vessel icon is pinned by SHA-256 in tests/test_vessels.py: SVGs are kept byte for byte (LF), so a fresh
# checkout under core.autocrlf=true does not turn them into CRLF and fail the pin (measured 2026-11-12).
*.svg -text
